title: "mRNAGen: open-source mRNA CDS + UTR design engine"
abstract: "mRNA sequence design engine combining naturalness (codon-pair), CAI, manufacturing-compliance penalties, and N1-methylpseudouridine-conditioned UTR scoring. Ranking components externally validated on GEMORNA Science 2025 SI data."
